# Yarlyn Amberstill's rabbits at Amberstill Ranch.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, Snowshoe; the new Arctic and Brown
# crates); Forever's client data (ItemSparse prices and the Arctic crate's
# name; every pet item teaches its companion when used).

step Yarlyn Amberstill
  tip Yarlyn Amberstill stands at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan, beside Veron Amberstill, the ram breeder. Each rabbit crate costs 20s; the Arctic and Brown crates are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 1263                         -- Yarlyn Amberstill
  buy 8497 npc 1263 optional          -- Rabbit Crate (Snowshoe), 20s
  buy 280797 "Rabbit Crate (Arctic)" npc 1263 optional -- 20s
  buy 280801 "Rabbit Crate (Brown)" npc 1263 optional -- 20s
